/-!
# Superanalysis kernel

Grassmann-algebra-valued functions on `ℝ^{2N}`, the supersymmetry generator `Q`, the
superintegral with BCHS normalisation, and the localization theorem (BCHS Thm 2.8); composition
of smooth functions with even superfunctions, the `ℍ^{2|4}` model and dimensional reduction
`ℍ^{2|4} → ℍ^{0|2}` (BCHS Prop 2.7).
See `docs/design/super.md`.
-/
